<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Audit finding M4 fixture — provenance and labeling.

  PROVENANCE: The field values below are transcribed from a REAL machine
  capture: a MacBook Air (macOS 27.2), published 2026-10-13 in the
  purplelink.llc guide "Check your Mac battery health, cycle count and
  voltage without installing anything" (retrieved 2026-11-20). First
  reading: Voltage 11509 mV, Amperage -1415 mA, CurrentCapacity 57,
  CycleCount 628, BatteryData DesignCapacity 4629 / NominalChargeCapacity
  3925 / FullChargeCapacity 3798 mAh.

  SYNTHESIZED WRAPPER: The sandbox has no Mac, so `ioreg -r -n
  AppleSmartBattery -d 1 -a -x` could not be captured here. The XML plist
  below reproduces the documented ioreg -a shape (array of dicts) around
  the real values; BatteryData-nested values are surfaced at the top level
  because the published capture's grep cut the root-level copies of those
  keys. The source printed Amperage as an unsigned-wrapped 64-bit value
  (18446744073709550201); the signed form -1415 shown here is the value
  the source itself recovers via bash arithmetic and plutil.

  KNOWN QUIRK, kept deliberately: this capture shows IsCharging = Yes while
  the pack is net DISCHARGING (-1415 mA, AvgTimeToEmpty 87 min) because the
  system load exceeded the 8 W adapter. The power sign must come from the
  Amperage data, not from the IsCharging flag — this fixture locks that in.
  The source capture also has NO Temperature key on this machine.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<array>
  <dict>
    <key>Voltage</key><integer>11509</integer>
    <key>Amperage</key><integer>-1415</integer>
    <key>CurrentCapacity</key><integer>57</integer>
    <key>MaxCapacity</key><integer>100</integer>
    <key>DesignCapacity</key><integer>4629</integer>
    <key>NominalChargeCapacity</key><integer>3925</integer>
    <key>FullChargeCapacity</key><integer>3798</integer>
    <key>CycleCount</key><integer>628</integer>
    <key>AvgTimeToEmpty</key><integer>87</integer>
    <key>ExternalConnected</key><true/>
    <key>IsCharging</key><true/>
    <key>FullyCharged</key><false/>
  </dict>
</array>
</plist>
